Q: How can I use a dynamic format string with the format! macro? A: <p>I have solved this exact problem with this crate: <a href="https://crates.io/crates/dfmt" rel="nofollow noreferrer">https://crates.io/crates/dfmt</a></p>
<p>Example:</p>
<pre class="lang-rust prettyprint-override"><code>let template_str = String::from(&quot;Hello, {world}!&quot;);
dfmt::dprintln!(template_str, world=&quot;World&quot;);
</code></pre>
